  "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"573\">Op zoek naar een high-end Android-tablet met ultieme prestaties en een haarscherp display? De <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"391\">Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra</strong> is een topklasse tablet met een gigantisch <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"462\">14,6 inch AMOLED-scherm</strong>, krachtige <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"486\">12GB RAM</strong>, en <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"507\">256GB opslag</strong> – perfect voor multitasken, streamen, tekenen of werken onderweg.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"765\">Deze tablet is <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"608\">in nette staat</strong>, wat betekent <strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"671\">amper gebruikt met minimale gebruikerssporen</strong>, en wordt geleverd <strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"719\">inclusief originele doos</strong>. <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"732\">Let op:</strong> de <strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"764\">S-Pen is niet inbegrepen</strong>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"913\">✅ Krachtige 12GB RAM + 256GB opslag<br data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"805\">✅ Prachtig AMOLED-scherm van 14,6 inch<br data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"846\">✅ In nette staat + originele doos<br data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"882\">✅ 3 maanden garantie inbegrepen</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"957\"><strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"957\">Op werkdagen besteld = snel verzonden!</strong></p>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1039\">📋 <strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1039\">Specificaties Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra – 12GB – 256GB – Wi-Fi</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1086\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1086\">📱 <strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1056\">Model:</strong> Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1111\">💾 <strong data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1103\">Opslag:</strong> 256GB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1132\">🧠 <strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1125\">RAM:</strong> 12GB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1165\">📶 <strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1157\">Connectiviteit:</strong> Wi-Fi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1212\">📐 <strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1182\">Scherm:</strong> 14,6 inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1291\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1233\">Prestaties:</strong> Zeer geschikt voor multitasking, creatief werk en media</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1315\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1307\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1349\">✏️ <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1331\">S-Pen:</strong> Niet inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1388\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1371\">Meegeleverd:</strong> Originele doos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1465\">🧼 <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1404\">Staat:</strong> In nette staat – amper gebruikt, minimale gebruikerssporen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"